Zeus, Kanavi, Faker, Chovy, Ruler e Keria.

47
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:05,305
Era outro verdadeiro dream team A
Coreia conquistou o ouro e Faker

48
00:03:05,345 --> 00:03:09,625
